      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Restore the pinned migration commit to the release ancestry**\n\nThe pinned `bec943174...` commit is not an ancestor of this release commit: both it and `acfd503...` have `e1a825bd...` as their parent. Consequently, planning this exact release with `npm run release:backend:plan -- --sha acfd50335a35c29eba7b9994b56969263f3068da` is rejected by the ancestry check in `scripts/production-release.mjs` with \u201crefusing to omit a registered migration,\u201d so this backend cannot be deployed through the guarded release path. Preserve the introducing commit in this branch's ancestry or register the migration against its actual introducing ancestor.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
