      "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Prefer a renderable resource for FanHub thumbnails**\n\nWhen an item has a primary resource without a usable thumbnail\u2014such as an unavailable resource, a non-YouTube resource with no `thumbnailUrl`, or a primary resource alongside an illustrated secondary resource\u2014this now selects that primary resource and renders an unavailable placeholder. The previous helper explicitly fell back from a primary resource with no thumbnail to any resource with a thumbnail, so multi-resource FanHub recovery cards lose valid artwork; preserve that fallback while also excluding resources marked unavailable.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.",
